@startuml
title Activity - Workspace Saving to Storage

start
:WorkspaceItem detects changes\n(tabs, groups, activeWindowId);
:WorkspaceItem.SaveToStorage();
:WorkspaceStore acquires mutex internally;
:Serialize workspaceMap\nto StoredState format;
:Write to chrome.storage.local;
:Update updatedAt timestamp\nin WorkspaceItem;
:Release mutex;
:Save complete;

stop

@enduml
